# Samsung Gallery Clone Walkthrough

This document outlines the features and usage of the Samsung Gallery Clone application.
    - **Buttons**: Click the `‹` and `›` arrows on the sides.
- **Gestures**:
    - **Zoom**: Pinch to zoom or use the mouse wheel.
    - **Pan**: Drag to move around when zoomed in.
    - **Double Tap**: Double click/tap to toggle zoom.
- **Video Playback**: 
    - Supports MP4, MKV, AVI, MOV.
    - Click to Play/Pause.
    - Auto-plays when swiped to.
- **Edit Mode**: Click "Edit" to enter a visual crop mode (placeholder).
- **Details**: Click "More" in the bottom toolbar to see file details (Name, Date, Path).

### 3. Albums View (Albums Tab)
- **Album Grid**: Displays folders containing images as albums.
- **Cover Image**: Shows the first image of the album as the cover.
- **Counts**: Displays the number of images in each album.

### 4. Menu & Settings
- **Select Folder**: Click "Select Folder" to choose a directory to scan.
- **Rebuild Cache**: Click "Rebuild Cache" to rescan the current folder.
- **Graphics API**: Select your preferred GPU backend (Direct3D 11, Vulkan, OpenGL, Software) from the dropdown. *Requires Restart*.
- **GPU Stats**: Displays current GPU renderer and driver info.

## How to Run

1.  **Portable Deployment (RECOMMENDED)**:
    - Navigate to the `deploy` folder.
    - Run [appSamsungGallery.exe](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/deploy/appSamsungGallery.exe).
    - **Note**: Running from here ensures all image plugins (JPEG, etc.) and Video plugins are loaded correctly.

2.  **From Source**:
    - Open the project in Qt Creator or VS Code.
    - Configure with Qt 6.9.3 (MinGW).
    - Build and Run.
    - *Note*: You may need to configure `QT_PLUGIN_PATH` if images do not load.

## Recent Improvements (Performance & Stability)

- **Crash Fix (Race Condition)**: Fixed a critical crash caused by a race condition in [AsyncImageProvider](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/AsyncImageProvider.h#28-43) when cancelling image loads (e.g., during fast scrolling or zooming).
- **Dynamic Zoom**: Improved Grid View zoom to maintain the position of the visible items, preventing "context loss" when resizing thumbnails.
- **Protocol Fix**: Resolved `Protocol "i" is unknown` error in Photo Viewer edit mode.
- **Performance**:
    - **Async Loading**: Implemented [cancel()](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/AsyncImageProvider.cpp#38-42) to abort off-screen image decoding, significantly improving responsiveness.
    - **Cache**: Increased `QCache` size to 512MB to prevent thumbnail thrashing.

## Architecture

- **Backend (C++)**:
    - [ImageModel](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/ImageModel.cpp#12-21): Handles scanning, sorting, and grouping of images. Supports JPG, PNG, WEBP, HEIC, MP4, etc.
    - `AlbumModel`: Scans for folders with images.
    - [SettingsHelper](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/SettingsHelper.cpp#7-9): Manages GPU preferences and system info.
- **Frontend (QML)**:
    - [Main.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/resources/qml/Main.qml): Core layout with `StackLayout` and `BottomBar`.
    - [GalleryView.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/resources/qml/GalleryView.qml): Grid display with date sections and error handling.
    - [PhotoViewer.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/resources/qml/PhotoViewer.qml): Advanced image/video viewer with `SwipeView`, `VideoOutput`, and gesture support.
